(wind-compensated-cruise-missile)
*title Synthetic wind-compensated cruise missile against a moving target
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*wind geodetic windv=30 windh=90 windd=0

*trajectory 1 missile start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=300 zdt=0 time=0 mass=100
  *file missile.dat time relrng[2] relvel[2] vair mach thrust yawi pitchi
  *segment 1 terminal-guidance
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.025 dtguid=1
    *inertial ecfc
    *aero cd=(cm-cd)
    *prop thrust=(cm-thrust) mdot=(cm-zero-mdot)
    *fly propnav=2
    *when relrng[2]<250 stop
    *when time=60 stop

*trajectory 2 target start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=12000 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=100 zdt=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file target.dat time xecfc yecfc
  *segment 1 ground-track
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.025
    *when time=60 stop
*end
